===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|legal}} A secondary [[lawsuit]], brought by a [[defendant]] in an original lawsuit, against a [[co-defendant]] in the original suit.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|legal|transitive}} To [[file]] such a [[secondary]] [[lawsuit]].

